# outputDirectory is ".", so anything left here is served publicly at its own URL.
# That is fine for the app, and was NOT fine for these.
#
# AUDIT.md in particular was reachable at https://playbook.chimaura.com/AUDIT.md —
# 60-odd KB describing every vulnerability found in this app and how each was fixed.
# A roadmap for anyone probing it. Verified 200 before this file existed.

# internal docs
*.md
!index.md

# server-side source: edge functions and migrations are not browser assets
supabase/

# Transactional email templates. confirm-email and reset-password get pasted into the
# Supabase dashboard by hand and are never fetched, so they stay out of the deploy.
#
# invite.html is the exception: send-invite fetches it at runtime, which keeps a 7KB
# template out of the function bundle and lets you edit the email by redeploying the
# site instead of the function. There is nothing to protect — the file exists to be
# mailed to strangers.
emails/*
!emails/invite.html

# tooling
.claude/
.env*
tests/
tools/
__pycache__/
